+> Obesity Surgery WA offers [gastric sleeve surgery](/gastric-sleeve-perth), [gastric bypass surgery](/gastric-bypass-perth), [mini gastric bypass](/mini-gastric-bypass), [gastric band surgery](/gastric-band), [revision bariatric surgery](/revision-bariatric-surgery) and [non-surgical weight management](/non-surgical-weight-loss). See [eligibility](/am-i-eligible), [Medicare and private health cover](/medicare-private-health-cover), [GP referral](/gp-referral), [surgeons](/surgeons), [FAQs](/faqs) and [book a consultation](/book-consultation).
