content-reviews/am-i-eligible.md:180:> **3. Will a mental health history stop me from being eligible?** A mental health history does not automatically rule out surgery. Psychological wellbeing is part of the assessment, and active or unstable concerns, an untreated eating disorder, substance misuse or difficulty following aftercare may affect timing or suitability. Your surgeon will discuss what support or further review may be needed.
