content-briefs/gastric-bypass-perth.md:38:The SERP is dominated by Perth bariatric clinic and surgeon procedure pages (perthweightlosssurgery.com.au, aurorabariatrics, perthsurgicalbariatrics, obesitysurgerywa, evolvebariatrics, drkevindolan) plus one high-authority hospital page (St John of God Murdoch, DR 70). Most ranking domains have low DR (7–26), so the niche is winnable on relevance and depth rather than backlink strength. Intent is mixed commercial/informational: searchers want to understand the procedure AND find a Perth surgeon to book. Google also surfaces a People Also Ask block (cost, the 30-30 rule, Medicare coverage, minimum weight) and dedicated Roux-en-Y bypass pages (evolvebariatrics, drkevindolan) — signalling that procedure-specific RYGB pages, not generic bariatric hubs, are what rank for this exact query.
