content-reviews/gastric-bypass-perth.md:322:> **Can gastric bypass be covered by Medicare?** For Roux-en-Y gastric bypass, MBS item 31572 may apply when the relevant criteria are met, but Medicare does not usually cover every cost. Your surgeon can confirm whether an MBS item applies; your private health fund can confirm hospital-cover requirements, waiting periods and policy exclusions.
