docs/oswa/content-review-2026-07/review/am-i-eligible.md:55:> If you are asking "am I eligible for weight loss surgery?", this page explains the clinical criteria used in assessment, including BMI, weight-related health conditions, previous weight loss attempts, and what happens when you meet the Obesity Surgery WA team.
