docs/oswa/content-review-2026-07/review/bariatric-surgery-perth.md:47:Why it matters: If only later GLP-1 references are removed, a prescription-medicine class reference still survives in the opening section; the writer followed the brief's medical-weight-management direction as instructed, so the brief also needs correction.
docs/oswa/content-review-2026-07/review/bariatric-surgery-perth.md:75:4. **Hospital names must be verified with the client before changing either direction**
